; `set` on a PARAMETER. This passed `check` until 2026-08-14 - the
; AX3012 refusal was suppressed whenever the binding recorded no
; binder span, and parameters record none - and then died inside
; codegen as AX4002, whose own note says "this is a compiler bug: the
; check that should have refused this program did not run".
; docs/memory-model.md MM-MUT-1a.
(:: f (-> Int Int))
(fn (f x) { (set x 1) x })
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (f 2))
